[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9780.389, "timestamp": "02:43:00", "text": "我凝视着这位神，看到了我自己。它是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9784.71, "timestamp": "02:43:04", "text": "好久不见。我见过梅珊"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9793.429, "timestamp": "02:43:13", "text": "互动。即使如此，我也很高兴我们谈过。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9796.71, "timestamp": "02:43:16", "text": "就像持续了一小会儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9798.95, "timestamp": "02:43:18", "text": "我觉得这样做有点失礼。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9802.15, "timestamp": "02:43:22", "text": "就像你知道的，呃，打个招呼，再见，然后就像"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9803.79, "timestamp": "02:43:23", "text": "离开"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9807.83, "timestamp": "02:43:27", "text": "VC，但我也不想让丹尼斯"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9816.79, "timestamp": "02:43:36", "text": "我知道，因为我真的感觉很自在。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9817.79, "timestamp": "02:43:37", "text": "说"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9821.07, "timestamp": "02:43:41", "text": "关于这首歌。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9825.429, "timestamp": "02:43:45", "text": "是的。是的，就是这样。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9828.15, "timestamp": "02:43:48", "text": "我的手机无法追踪位置。到底是怎么回事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9839.55, "timestamp": "02:43:59", "text": "唵。你真的"}]